      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 9 — Employees API\n\nAdditive, no other workflow calls or is called by this one.\n\n`GET /api/employees` — list\n`POST /api/employees` — create (auto-assigns the next A<n> id)\n`POST /api/employees/update` — patch name/phone/active/available/\nmax_open_conversations/role/working_hours/timezone. agent_id is\nimmutable — every conversation row already points at it.\n\nEvery path requires `X-Management-Key` matching `MANAGEMENT_API_KEY`.\nFails CLOSED: unset key -> 500, wrong key -> 401. No unsigned opt-out\n(unlike the WhatsApp webhooks) — this surface has no HMAC/Meta signature\nprotecting it otherwise, and it reads/writes names and phone numbers.",
